.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-checkin 1  "checkin " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-checkin \- Check a routine in for a day (default today)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit checkin\fR [\fB\-\-date\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIR\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check a routine in for a day (default today)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-date\fR \fI<DATE>\fR
YYYY\-MM\-DD
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable ANSI colors
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIR\fR>

.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit checkin 1
  orbit checkin 1 \-\-date 2026\-11\-19
  orbit checkin 1 \-\-dry\-run
